{"bodyClass":"column-1 lolalab chrome chrome153 r800","middleHtml":"<section id=\"middle\" class=\"wrapper\"> \t\t\t<div id=\"content\"> \t\t\t\t \t\t\t\t\t <nav class=\"wd-browsing-breadcrumbs\">     <b class=\"location\">Você está em:</b>     <ul itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\">                                   <li class=\"first\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ListItem\">                     <a href=\"/\" itemprop=\"item\" title=\"Página Inicial\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Página Inicial</span></a>                     <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\">                 </li>                                                              </ul> </nav>  \t\t\t\t \t\t\t\t<div id=\"content-wrapper\">\t\t\t\t\t \t\t\t\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://use.typekit.net/bdv3jdn.css\">  <div id=\"lp-lolalab\">   <section class=\"ll-hero\" aria-label=\"LolaLab\">     <div class=\"ll-hero__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>     <div class=\"ll-hero__content\">       <h1>LolaLab<span>.</span></h1>     </div>   </section>    <main id=\"lolalab-conteudo\">     <section class=\"ll-award\" aria-labelledby=\"ll-award-title\">       <div class=\"ll-award__bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>       <div class=\"ll-award__inner\">         <header class=\"ll-section-heading ll-section-heading--center\">           <h2 id=\"ll-award-title\">Prêmio de Máscara Rapunzel nos EUA</h2>           <p>Reconhecida internacionalmente</p>         </header>          <div class=\"ll-award__cards\" aria-label=\"Destaques do prêmio\">           <article>             <span class=\"ll-award__icon ll-award__icon--flame\">               <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/icone-premio-fortalecimento.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">             </span>             <p>Performance do produto <br>em fortalecimento</p>           </article>           <article>             <span class=\"ll-award__icon ll-award__icon--shine\">               <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/icone-premio-brilho.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">             </span>             <p>Performance em hidratação <br>e brilho dos fios.</p>           </article>           <article class=\"ll-award__wide\">             <p>Avaliação máxima (5/5), evidenciando sua aceitação <br>e destaque no mercado internacional</p>           </article>         </div>       </div>     </section>      <section class=\"ll-seals\" aria-label=\"Selos e certificações LolaLab\" style=\"--ll-seals-arrow-top: 273.671875px;\">       <div class=\"ll-wrap ll-seals__grid\" data-seals-track=\"\">         <article class=\"ll-seal-card\">           <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/selo-vegano.png\" alt=\"Selo vegano\" loading=\"lazy\">           <p>Organização brasileira que atua na promoção do veganismo e na certificação dos produtos que não utilizam ingredientes de origem animal e não envolvem testes em animais.</p>           <div class=\"ll-seal-card__details\">             <h3>O papo é reto aqui na Lola:</h3>             <ul>               <li>Não contém ingredientes de origem animal</li>               <li>Não é testado em animais (nem pelo fabricante, nem por terceiros)</li>               <li>Atendemos aos critérios definidos pela associação para produtos veganos.</li>             </ul>           </div>         </article>          <article class=\"ll-seal-card\">           <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/selo-pea.png\" alt=\"Selo PEA\" loading=\"lazy\">           <p>ONG brasileira voltada à proteção animal e à promoção do consumo consciente</p>           <div class=\"ll-seal-card__details\">             <h3>Ou seja, Lolete:</h3>             <ul>               <li>Não realizamos testes em animais</li>               <li>Não contratamos terceiros para testar em animais</li>               <li>Assumimos um compromisso público com práticas cruelty-free</li>             </ul>           </div>         </article>       </div>       <div class=\"ll-seals__navigation\" aria-label=\"Navegação dos selos\">         <button class=\"ll-seals__arrow ll-seals__arrow--prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Ver selo anterior\" data-seals-prev=\"\" hidden=\"\">           <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"20\" fill=\"white\"></circle><path d=\"m22.5 13-7 7 7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea136a\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>         </button>         <div class=\"ll-seals__dots\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Escolher selo\" data-seals-dots=\"\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ll-seals__dot is-active\" aria-label=\"Ver selo 1\" aria-current=\"true\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ll-seals__dot\" aria-label=\"Ver selo 2\" aria-current=\"false\"></button></div>         <button class=\"ll-seals__arrow ll-seals__arrow--next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Ver próximo selo\" data-seals-next=\"\">           <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"20\" fill=\"white\"></circle><path d=\"m17.5 13 7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea136a\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>         </button>       </div>     </section>      <section class=\"ll-feature ll-feature--logistics\" aria-labelledby=\"ll-logistics-title\">       <div class=\"ll-wrap ll-feature__grid\">         <div class=\"ll-feature__image\">           <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/logistica-reversa.png\" alt=\"Produto Lola Morte Súbita em destaque\" loading=\"lazy\">         </div>         <div class=\"ll-feature__content\">           <div class=\"ll-title-row\">             <span class=\"ll-title-icon ll-title-icon--green\" aria-hidden=\"true\">               <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 7h8l-2.5-2.5M17 17H9l2.5 2.5M4.5 13a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 11.7 4.9M19.5 11A7.5 7.5 0 0 0 7.8 6.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>             </span>             <h2 id=\"ll-logistics-title\">Logística Reversa 100%</h2>           </div>           <p>Nosso material da embalagem é tecnicamente reciclável, podendo ser reprocessado e reinserido na cadeia produtiva, quando destinado corretamente aos sistemas de coleta e reciclagem.</p>           <p>Isso significa que, após o uso, a embalagem pode ser coletada, separada, reciclada e transformada em novos produtos, reduzindo a necessidade de matéria-prima virgem e contribuindo para a diminuição do impacto ambiental.</p>           <ul class=\"ll-benefit-list\">             <li>Redução de resíduos enviados a aterros</li>             <li>Otimização do uso de recursos naturais</li>             <li>Estímulo à cadeia de reciclagem</li>           </ul>         </div>       </div>     </section>      <section class=\"ll-feature ll-feature--compact\" aria-labelledby=\"ll-iso-title\">       <div class=\"ll-wrap ll-feature__grid\">         <div class=\"ll-feature__image\">           <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/certificacao-iso-22716.png\" alt=\"Certificação ISO 22716\" loading=\"lazy\">         </div>         <div class=\"ll-feature__content\">           <div class=\"ll-title-row\">             <span class=\"ll-title-icon ll-title-icon--pink\" aria-hidden=\"true\">               <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 19 6v5c0 4.6-2.8 8.6-7 10-4.2-1.4-7-5.4-7-10V6l7-3Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>             </span>             <h2 id=\"ll-iso-title\">ISO 22716 GMP</h2>           </div>           <p>Somos certificados pela ISO 22716, norma internacional que estabelece as Boas Práticas de Fabricação para a indústria cosmética. Nossos processos seguem padrões globais rigorosos, com controle, rastreabilidade e excelência em todas as etapas produtivas, garantindo a qualidade, segurança e consistência dos nossos produtos.</p>         </div>       </div>     </section>      <section class=\"ll-feature ll-feature--plife\" aria-labelledby=\"ll-plife-title\">       <div class=\"ll-wrap ll-feature__grid\">         <div class=\"ll-feature__content\">           <div class=\"ll-title-row\">             <span class=\"ll-title-icon ll-title-icon--purple\" aria-hidden=\"true\">               <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/icone-plife-fragrance.svg\" alt=\"\">             </span>             <h2 id=\"ll-plife-title\">P-life e B-flex</h2>           </div>           <p>As nossas embalagens de 250 g, 500 g e 1 kg possuem aditivo de P-Life ao Polietileno, matéria-prima da embalagem, e com isso redução do tempo de degradação junto à natureza.</p>         </div>         <div class=\"ll-plife-art\" aria-label=\"Produto aprovado em formulação\">           <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/produto-plife-bflex.png\" alt=\"Produto Lola aprovado em formulação\" loading=\"lazy\">           <span class=\"ll-plife-art__badge\">#Aprovado</span>           <span class=\"ll-plife-art__note\">             <span class=\"ll-plife-art__note-title\">               <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/icone-formulacao.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">               <strong>Formulação</strong>             </span>             <small>v2.4 Final</small>           </span>         </div>       </div>     </section>      <section class=\"ll-feature ll-feature--energy\" aria-labelledby=\"ll-energy-title\">       <div class=\"ll-wrap ll-feature__grid\">         <div class=\"ll-feature__image\">           <img src=\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/energia-solar.png\" alt=\"Instalação de painéis solares\" loading=\"lazy\">         </div>         <div class=\"ll-feature__content\">           <div class=\"ll-title-row\">             <span class=\"ll-title-icon ll-title-icon--orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\">               <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 4V2m0 20v-2m8-8h2M2 12h2m13.7-5.7 1.4-1.4M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4m0-11.4L4.9 4.9m14.2 14.2-1.4-1.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle></svg>             </span>             <h2 id=\"ll-energy-title\">Energia Verde</h2>           </div>           <p>Nossa fábrica utiliza 100% de energia proveniente de fonte solar, gerada por meio de sistemas fotovoltaicos próprios. Permitimos que todas as atividades produtivas sejam realizadas com base em uma fonte limpa, renovável e de baixo impacto ambiental, reduzindo significativamente a emissão de gases de efeito estufa e a dependência de fontes energéticas convencionais. É babado ou não é, Lolete?</p>         </div>       </div>     </section>   </main> </div>  <style> body.lolalab .wd-browsing-breadcrumbs {   display: none !important; }  body.lolalab #middle, body.lolalab #content, body.lolalab #content-wrapper {   width: 100% !important;   max-width: 100% !important;   padding-left: 0 !important;   padding-right: 0 !important; }  #lp-lolalab {   --ll-black: #1c1c1c;   --ll-gray: #4a5565;   --ll-bg: #f5f5f5;   --ll-pink: #ea136a;   --ll-green: #31c831;   --ll-hero-desk: url(\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/banner-topo-desk.png\");   --ll-hero-mobile: url(\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/hero-mobile.png\");   --ll-award-bg: url(\"/Custom/Content/Themes/Lola/Templates/LolaLab%20LP/assets/premio-rapunzel-fundo-produto.png\");   width: 100%;   max-width: 100%;   margin: 0 auto;   overflow: hidden;   background: var(--ll-bg);   color: var(--ll-black);   font-family: \"Lato\", Arial, sans-serif; }  #lp-lolalab, #lp-lolalab * {   box-sizing: border-box; }  #lp-lolalab img {   display: block;   max-width: 100%; }  #lp-lolalab a {   color: inherit;   text-decoration: none; }  #lp-lolalab p, #lp-lolalab h1, #lp-lolalab h2, #lp-lolalab h3 {   margin: 0; }  .ll-wrap {   width: min(1110px, calc(100% - 40px));   margin: 0 auto; }  .ll-hero {   position: relative;   min-height: 0;   aspect-ratio: 1366 / 576;   overflow: hidden;   background: #93e7d6; }  .ll-hero__media {   position: absolute;   inset: 0;   background-image: var(--ll-hero-desk);   background-position: center;   background-size: cover; }  .ll-hero__content {   position: absolute;   top: 17.4%;   left: 13.7%;   width: 473px; }  .ll-hero h1 {   font-family: \"Obviously\", \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;   font-size: clamp(54px, 7.32vw, 100px);   font-weight: 800;   line-height: 1.3;   letter-spacing: 1px; }  .ll-hero h1 span {   color: var(--ll-pink); }  .ll-button {   position: absolute;   top: 305px;   left: 118px;   display: inline-flex;   align-items: center;   justify-content: center;   min-width: 238px;   min-height: 49px;   padding: 16px 28px;   border-radius: 8px;   background: var(--ll-green);   color: var(--ll-black);   font-family: \"Obviously\", \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;   font-size: 12px;   font-weight: 800;   line-height: 1.3;   letter-spacing: 1px;   text-align: center; }  @media (min-width: 768px) {   .ll-hero__content {     inset: 0;     width: auto;   }    .ll-hero h1 {     display: none;   }    .ll-hero .ll-button {     top: 70.3%;     left: 22.3%;     width: 17.4%;     min-width: 0;     min-height: 8.5%;     padding: 0;     opacity: 0;   } }  .ll-award {   position: relative;   min-height: 587px;   overflow: hidden;   background: #80d2f5; }  .ll-award__bg {   position: absolute;   inset: 0;   background-image: var(--ll-award-bg);   background-position: center;   background-size: cover; }  .ll-award__inner {   position: relative;   z-index: 1;   width: min(1110px, calc(100% - 40px));   height: 587px;   margin: 0 auto; }  .ll-section-heading {   font-family: \"Obviously\", \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;   letter-spacing: 1px;   color: var(--ll-black); }  .ll-section-heading--center {   padding-top: 48px;   text-align: center; }  .ll-section-heading h2 {   font-size: clamp(26px, 2.05vw, 28px);   font-weight: 800;   line-height: 1.3; }  .ll-section-heading p {   margin-top: 4px;   font-family: \"Lato\", Arial, sans-serif;   font-size: 16px;   font-weight: 600;   line-height: 1.2; }  .ll-award__cards {   position: absolute;   top: 237px;   right: 0;   display: grid;   grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));   gap: 16px 13px;   width: 465px; }  .ll-award__cards article {   display: flex;   height: 123px;   flex-direction: column;   align-items: center;   justify-content: center;   gap: 8px;   padding: 8px;   border-radius: 16px;   background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);   text-align: center; }  .ll-award__cards p {   font-size: 14px;   font-weight: 700;   line-height: 1.3; }  .ll-award__wide {   grid-column: 1 / -1;   height: 68px !important; }  .ll-award__icon {   display: flex;   width: 42px;   height: 42px;   flex: 0 0 42px;   align-items: center;   justify-content: center;   border-radius: 8px;   background: #fff4e5; }  .ll-award__icon img {   display: block; }  .ll-award__icon--flame img {   width: 24.22px;   height: 24px; }  .ll-award__icon--shine img {   width: 25px;   height: 25px; }  .ll-seals {   padding: 48px 0;   background: var(--ll-bg); }  .ll-seals__grid {   display: grid;   grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 356px));   justify-content: center;   gap: 16px; }  .ll-seals__navigation {   display: none; }  .ll-seal-card {   display: flex;   min-height: 440px;   flex-direction: column;   align-items: center;   gap: 16px;   padding: 32px 16px;   border-radius: 8px;   background: #fff; }  .ll-seal-card > img {   width: 120px;   height: 130px;   object-fit: contain; }  .ll-seal-card > p {   min-height: 49px;   color: #1e1e1e;   font-size: 12px;   line-height: 1.3; }  .ll-seal-card__details {   width: 100%;   padding-top: 16px;   border-top: 1px solid #ececec; }  .ll-seal-card h3 {   margin-bottom: 16px;   font-size: 16px;   font-weight: 900;   line-height: 1.3;   text-align: center; }  .ll-seal-card ul, .ll-benefit-list {   display: flex;   flex-direction: column;   gap: 8px;   margin: 0;   padding: 0;   list-style: none; }  .ll-seal-card li, .ll-benefit-list li {   position: relative;   min-height: 25px;   padding-left: 33px;   color: #1e1e1e;   font-size: 14px;   line-height: 1.3; }  .ll-seal-card li::before {   content: \"\";   position: absolute;   top: 0;   left: 0;   width: 25px;   height: 25px;   border-radius: 50%;   background: #fff;   box-shadow: 0 1px 1.5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }  .ll-seal-card li::after {   content: \"\";   position: absolute;   top: 7px;   left: 8px;   width: 8px;   height: 5px;   border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ll-pink);   border-left: 2px solid var(--ll-pink);   transform: rotate(-45deg); }  .ll-feature {   padding: 24px 0;   background: #fff; }  .ll-feature + .ll-feature {   padding-top: 24px; }  .ll-feature__grid {   display: grid;   grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 563px) minmax(0, 1fr);   align-items: center;   gap: 80px; }  .ll-feature__image {   overflow: hidden;   border-radius: 8px; }  .ll-feature__image img {   width: 100%;   height: 100%;   max-height: 417px;   object-fit: cover; }  .ll-feature__content {   display: flex;   flex-direction: column;   gap: 16px; }  .ll-feature__content p {   color: var(--ll-gray);   font-size: 16px;   font-weight: 500;   line-height: 1.55; }  .ll-title-row {   display: flex;   align-items: center;   gap: 8px; }  .ll-title-row h2 {   font-family: \"Obviously\", \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;   font-size: 21px;   font-weight: 800;   